COMPND  11 K107A, E196A, N197A, A239H, K243H, K263A, A336V, I341V, E383A, E386A,
COMPND  12 D387A AND R391N (CORRESPONDING TO I28T, D108A, K109A, E198A, N199A,  
COMPND  13 A241H, K245H, K265A, A338V, I343V, E385A, E388A, D389A AND R393N IN  
COMPND  14 P0AEX9). RESIDUES 395-710 ARE FROM HUMAN UROMODULIN PROTEIN AND      
